	(text "STEP COUNTER, one-hot: T0N (0 = step S0, so reset lands in S0), T1..T4.  Next state: S0 -> S1; S1 -> S2 if the opcode is two-word (TWO) else S3; S2 -> S3; S3 -> S4 unless DONE; S4 or DONE -> S0.  II = T0, PCE = T1 or T2, OPI = T2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
