	(text "MATRIX ROWS: one per instruction for S3, and for S4 where the instruction uses it (the four memory accesses).  Row = NOR(OPn#, T3N) or NOR(OPn#, T4N); family rows also include F#.  JC/JZ have a conditional row for PCL: NOR(OP#, T3N, flag-not).  10k pull-ups: a row drives up to ten diodes into 1 Meg column pull-downs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 1358.9 0)
